  <item>
    <title>「攒钱实录」3年攒下12万的佛系95后</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e9343c8e6f71a5b78e43d2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e9343c8e6f71a5b78e43d2</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 07 Mar 2024 03:27:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“拼命”攒钱的年轻人，可以用这样的词来形容小杨同学。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当攒钱成为生活中的习惯，兜里余粮带来的安全感，是他行走人间的底气。</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目大纲：</span></p><span></span><p><span>● 攒钱目标和习惯：享受攒钱的感觉，计划在5年内攒够30万。</span></p><span></span><p><span>● 消费观念和攒钱技巧：记账、免费游玩、外带经济、信用卡羊毛等攒钱小技巧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>● 坚定执行攒钱计划：享受攒钱带来的满足感。</span></p><span></span><p><span>● 如何避免消费误区：避免盲从和从众心理，量入为出，不超前消费。</span></p><span></span><p><span>● 投资技能升级之路：有幸结识到一批志同道合的同路人一起进步。</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>BGM: &nbsp;Martin Ermen - Hold Back the RiverHang in there</span></em></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loi8mp19cTwTmaPr6wzXxxUAh4w2.m4a" length="8221825" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:08:29</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZrYlBzLXBIVHZYZDBOQ0xGUGJWTFcyYVZ1YUMucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
