    <title>不会修飞机的产品经理不是好的投资者</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/629618155cf4a5ad60ca0fd9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">629618155cf4a5ad60ca0fd9</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 31 May 2022 13:28:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>第01期，嘉宾：土豆雷。</span></p><span></span><p><span>她是刚刚入职且慢的一名同路人，同时也是一个非常“有故事”的女同学，修飞机专业、做过产品经理、写过公众号、做过旅游博主、最后“沦为”且慢打工人；她从大学开始折腾投资，亏了30%-40%，最后回归简单~</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目就带大家认识这个可爱的女同学~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期听点</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a>S</span></strong><span> 曾经有一个年薪90万的机会摆在我面前</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="163">02:43</a>S</span></strong><span> 16年，我买了医疗</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a>S</span></strong><span> 签了“生死状”，去朝鲜旅游</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="418">06:58</a>S</span></strong><span> 我以为我能抗住40%的回撤</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a>S</span></strong><span> 认识且慢后，我绝对不会想买且慢股票</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="664">11:04</a>S</span></strong><span> 入职且慢后：且慢赚钱且慢花，一分别想带回家</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="826">13:46</a>S</span></strong><span> 成功入职且慢的经验分享</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="888">14:48</a>S</span></strong><span> 我对且慢这个地方不是很满意呢？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1075">17:55</a>S</span></strong><span> 在且慢工作初体验：说好的“且慢”呢？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1173">19:33</a>S</span></strong><span> 我希望能再多跌点</span></p><span></span><p><span>风险提示：市场有风险，投资需谨慎。</span></p>]]></description>
